    DAT_FILE_LBL: 'One game, as stored',
    DAT_FILE_P: '<code>Library.txt</code> is a plain text file with one block per game, simple enough to read and edit by hand. A database would be tidier, but a text file can still be opened and understood years later, with or without Parallax.',
